# --- Domestic Banking & Financial Services ---
# Target: China Merchants Bank (招商银行 / 掌上生活 App)
# Source: Loon log trace 2026-10-01 | Reason: Credit card image CDN & mobile banking falling to FINAL (HK proxy)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cmbchina.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cmbimg.com

# Target: China UnionPay & CloudPay (中国银联 / 云闪付)
# Source: Audit 2026-10-01 | Reason: UnionPay gateway CNAME to Wangsu CDN resolves to US (157.185.x.x) under overseas DoH
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,unionpay.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,unionpaysecure.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,95516.com

